# API

Contract: `docs/architecture/api-outline.md`. Register every path in `backend/internal/app/routes/v1/routes.go`.

- JSON is snake_case inside `{ code, message, data, meta? }` via `dto.Success` / `dto.Error`.
- Path id is the vehicle UUID. VIN is a body or query field.
- Catalog reads under `/api/v1/catalog`.
- Correct fields with `PATCH /api/v1/vehicles/:id`.
- Stock out with `POST …/stock-out`.
- Set proposed action with `PUT …/proposed-action`.
- Primary image: `PUT`, `DELETE`, and `GET` on `…/primary-image`. GET streams bytes.

```go
// POST /api/v1/vehicles/:id/stock-out { "stocked_out_on": "2026-10-25" }
```
